WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.357 --> 00:00:08.082
You’re not angry with her at all
for liking women.

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:10.890
You’re grateful she told you.
[BUT FIRST, LET’S DO A BRIEFING.]

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:12.894
You’re grateful she told you.

00:00:13.979 --> 00:00:14.709
Mom.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:18.690
[THEY PLAY THEIR ROLES SO WELL!]

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:24.050
[LET’S GET SOME GROUP SHOTS.]

00:00:25.419 --> 00:00:25.908
Come on, guys.

00:00:25.952 --> 00:00:29.420
One, two, three.
[EVERYONE’S HERE.]

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.370
[FIGURING OUT THE SCENE.]

00:00:41.459 --> 00:00:43.357
(Not many scenes today,
but each one is tough.)

00:00:44.625 --> 00:00:45.219
Not really.

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:48.210
[RIGHT, BECAUSE YOU’RE SO GREAT, SIR.]

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:54.810
[OH, SHE NOTICED THE CAMERA.]

00:00:54.853 --> 00:00:56.478
(That wasn’t a real dental treatment room, was it?)

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:57.955
Are you an unlicensed dentist?

00:00:57.964 --> 00:00:58.991
Tell that to the camera.

00:01:00.225 --> 00:01:01.514
Those innocent eyes.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:03.330
[LOOKING COMPLETELY INNOCENT.]

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:08.290
[SOMEONE LOOKS COLD.]

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:19.090
[SIBLINGS AT IT AGAIN.]

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:24.330
[N’DOKRAK IS HERE TO CHECK ON YOU.]

00:01:27.641 --> 00:01:30.445
You say, “Excuse me,
I have to go handle something.”

00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:31.874
[PREPARING TO SHOOT.]

00:01:31.874 --> 00:01:33.408
“You take care of each other.”
[PREPARING TO SHOOT.]

00:01:33.408 --> 00:01:33.410
[PREPARING TO SHOOT.]

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:40.810
[SO, THIS IS HOW YOU COMFORT SOMEONE?]

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:57.730
[THE REHEARSAL IS ALREADY CUTE.]

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:08.010
[DOKRAK, “CUT” HAS BEEN CALLED.]

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:15.290
[ALL RIGHT, TIME FOR A FACIAL MASSAGE.]

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:26.050
[WORKING TOO HARD, HUH?]

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:35.290
[LET’S SNAP SOME SHOTS OF YOU TWO.]

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:45.850
[SUPER CLINGY.]

00:02:52.743 --> 00:02:53.552
All right.

00:02:56.365 --> 00:02:57.410
Then you say, “I’ll see you later.”

00:02:57.745 --> 00:02:59.922
And then Pam grabs her purse.

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:01.505
(This is just acting, right?)

00:03:02.324 --> 00:03:04.640
I’m really into my character.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:07.850
[COMPLETELY IMMERSED IN HER ROLE.]

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:17.530
You’ll do this while comforting her.
[SHOWING THE EXPECTED PERFORMANCE.]

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:22.106
You’ll do this while comforting her.

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:24.722
Because she makes a face as if to say,

00:03:25.339 --> 00:03:26.722
“Does it have to be today?”

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:28.933
(Wash your hands with alcohol.)

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.290
[OUCH! THAT’S HARSH!]

00:03:31.472 --> 00:03:32.730
Can I have some hand sanitizer, please?

00:03:32.745 --> 00:03:34.183
I just touched Oat’s face. (*A staff member)

00:03:34.183 --> 00:03:35.149
(Why?)

00:03:36.983 --> 00:03:38.579
P’Oat looked so adorable just now.

00:03:39.524 --> 00:03:41.488
(Get your face close to the tank.)

00:03:42.324 --> 00:03:44.232
(Squeeze in. The tank is really small.)

00:03:46.697 --> 00:03:49.078
(Yes, just like that.)

00:03:52.179 --> 00:03:52.779
Kiss her.

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:56.490
[DO YOU HAVE TO KISS FOR REAL
DURING A REHEARSAL?]

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:05.450
[LET’S SWITCH POSITIONS.]

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:15.650
[SHE LOVES PLAYING WITH THE CAMERA.]

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.850
[CAN’T GET ANY SWEETER!]

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:34.490
SATURDAYS, 8:30 P.M. ON GMM25

